CSF - Core Shield Firewall (formerly "cPanel Shield Firewall") is a
next-generation fork of ConfigServer Security & Firewall (CSF), originally
written by Way to the Web Ltd. (ConfigServer) and distributed under the
GNU General Public License version 3. The CSF name, the csf.conf / csf.allow /
csf.deny / csf.ignore file model and the Login Failure Daemon (LFD) concept
come from that project. CSF 2.x is a rewrite on native nftables.

