Third-party data used at run time (downloaded by the server, not included in
this repository):
  - Spamhaus DROP / EDROP, abuse.ch Feodo Tracker, CINS Army, IPsum and
    Blocklist.de reputation feeds (Threat Intelligence; each under its own terms)
  - R-fx Networks Linux Malware Detect (rfxn) signatures, GPL-2.0
  - YARA-Forge rule packages, under the licenses of their individual rules
  - ClamAV and YARA are installed from the operating system's repositories

